WEBVTT

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.176
There's a better photo of it.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.976
So that particular event
was inspired by a moment

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.336
that I happened to stumble upon.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.856
The next project I want to show

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.696
was given to me
in an email from a stranger.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.056
A high school kid in Texas
wrote me in 2006

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.536
and said, "You should get
as many people as possible

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.136
to put on blue polo shirts and khaki pants

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.416
and go into a Best Buy and stand around."

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.856
(Laughter)

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.136
(Applause)

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:32.656
So I wrote this high school kid
back immediately